+Feature: Root index page
+  The working todo app must render and run in a real browser. The app is
+  served from a real index.html at the project root, built from the
+  human-owned template assets/app-template.index.html, and wired to the
+  production script js/app.js. The existing behaviour suite drives the
+  template plus js/app.js inside a DOM realm; this scenario pins the
+  served page a browser actually opens.
+
+  Scenario: Root index.html serves the todo app and loads js/app.js
+    Given the project root has a real "index.html" file
+    And that page is built from the template "assets/app-template.index.html"
+    Then the page contains the todo input, the todo list section, and the footer
+    And the page loads the application script "js/app.js"
